{"root":"birgil_1","nodes":{"birgil_1":{"m":"Welcome to my tavern. Please have a seat anywhere.","r":[["What can I get to drink around here?","birgil_2",[]]],"w":[]},"birgil_2":{"m":"Well, unfortunately, with the mine tunnel collapsed, we cannot trade much with the outside villages.","r":[["N","birgil_3",[]]],"w":[]},"birgil_3":{"m":"However, I do have a huge supply of mead that I stocked up on before the mine shaft collapsed.","r":[["Mead? Yuck. Too sweet for my taste.","birgil_4",[]],["Alright! Just my kind of taste. Let's see what you have to trade.","S",[]],["Very well, it will have to do. I guess it has some healing potential. Let's trade.","S",[]]],"w":[]},"birgil_4":{"m":"Suit yourself. That's what I've got anyway.","r":[["OK, let's trade anyway.","S",[]],["Never mind, goodbye.","X",[]]],"w":[]}},"q":{},"i":{},"mo":{},"f":{},"sk":{"weaponChance":"Weapon Accuracy","weaponDmg":"Hard Hit","barter":"Merchant","dodge":"Dodge","barkSkin":"Bark Skin","moreCriticals":"More Criticals","betterCriticals":"Better Criticals","speed":"Combat Speed","coinfinder":"Treasure Hunter","moreExp":"Quick Learner","cleave":"Cleave","eater":"Corpse Eater","fortitude":"Increased Fortitude","evasion":"Evasion","regeneration":"Regeneration","lowerExploss":"Failure Mastery","magicfinder":"Magic Finder","resistanceMental":"Strong Mind","resistancePhysical":"Enduring Body","resistanceBlood":"Pure Blood","shadowBless":"Dark blessing of the Shadow","crit1":"Internal bleeding","crit2":"Fracture","rejuvenation":"Rejuvenation","taunt":"Taunt","concussion":"Concussion","weaponProficiencyDagger":"Dagger proficiency","weaponProficiency1hsword":"One-handed sword proficiency","weaponProficiency2hsword":"Two-handed sword proficiency","weaponProficiencyAxe":"Axe proficiency","weaponProficiencyBlunt":"Blunt weapon proficiency","weaponProficiencyUnarmed":"Unarmed fighting","weaponProficiencyPole":"Pole weapon proficiency","armorProficiencyShield":"Shield proficiency","armorProficiencyUnarmored":"Unarmor